// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreyClue1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2302369609" "Mysterious researchers"
// DetailString :
"P1368423417" "When you rescued Dr. Fibes and the other soldiers and scientist who had been captured by the creatures of the Shadow Shard, he told you something that stuck in your mind: <br><br>'We were performing a sweep to collect indiginous plant life, when Private Tufnel spotted what looked like another group of researchers. However, no one else was supposed to be out on Point Foxtrot today. When Tufnel went to contact them, they bolted as if they'd been discovered. They also refused to make radio contact. <br><br>When we reached the spot where they had been, we found that they'd netted and begun to dissect a Natterling. We had little time to examine the site and find out who those strange people might have been, as the dying Natterling's bretheren attacked us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreyTech 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2569898837" "Pieces of Crey technology"
// DetailString :
"P1168249038" "You found several pieces of Crey manufactured technology in the possesion of the Shard's creatures. Though these items are ruined, they were all manufactured within the last year."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreyClue2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1615090424" "A soldier's fate"
// DetailString :
"P709514765" "This dead serviceman was slain defending the scientists in his charge. However, you note that he seems to have been killed by high-tech weaponry. You can't be sure, but once you return his body for autopsy, then the knowledged gained by his sad fate may save other lives."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Creynappers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4150095483" "Kidnapped explorers"
// DetailString :
"P3425381135" "After rescuing them from the Rularuu, one of the explorers told you: <br><br>It was horrible. We were just setting up a weather station to try and track the winds around here when we heard things erupt in violence. We didn't get a good look at who attacked us, but they struck quickly. All the soldiers were dead or injured, and whoever attacked took several other scientists. The rest of us escaped in here, and then the Rularuu were on us. However, I don't know if the Rularuu were the ones who attacked us in the first place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreyHunters 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2214552535" "Orders from Crey BioPharmeceuticals"
// DetailString :
"P2823632548" "You captured these orders from Crey explorers in the Shadow Shard. They state that these men were to capture local creatures for observation and experimentation. There might be enough information here to work out where the creatures were going to be taken."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreyLocations 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1107614772" "Transfer orders"
// DetailString :
"P3432433485" "You found these orders on the leader of a Crey forward base at point Echo. They tell Dr. Pither, the forward base's leader, where to send his specimens. This information could show the locations of several more Crey bases in the Shadow Shard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NotSupply 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1018338219" "Supply records"
// DetailString :
"P4174272065" "Your team captured these supply records at the last of a series of 4 Crey bases within the Shadow Shard. They show that this base was being re-supplied from another base, but leave only a few tantalizing clues about where that other base might be. <br><br>You do notice several large transfers of 'captured specimens' back to another base, but that base is in Paragon City. You have to wonder how Crey could be moving these shipments without Portal Corp spotting the dimensional transfer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PortalsItIs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1980529851" "Crey Network Emails"
// DetailString :
"P2634258920" "You discovered these emails while capturing an illegal Crey base that was holding creatures captured in the Shadow Shard. There are several messages about the Shadow Shard creatures that Crey has been experimenting on, but the most important thing is the numerous references to interdimensional transfers made with the 'Newly acquired portal technology'. <br><br>There are no hints about how this new portal technology was acquired or how it works."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Portalbuilder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1943354383" "A make-shift portal device"
// DetailString :
"P2612131665" "Your team destroyed this strange machine while battling Crey forces and escaped Rularuu creatures in a Crey lab in Paragon City. The Rularuu had cobbled together a rudimentary portal device to try and return to their strange home world. What this implies about their hidden technical capability is incredible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NemesisBluePrints 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P957487984" "Portal device blueprints"
// DetailString :
"P1778714410" "These blueprints detail how to make a portal gate-way that's undetectable by Portal Corp's sensors. The strange technology confirms the origin of the design just as much as the watermarks and signatures on the blueprints themselves. These plans belong to Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NemesisCreyContracts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2505001321" "Villainous Contracts"
// DetailString :
"P114046272" "These ponderous legal documents detail the complex contracts between the Nemesis Army and a sub-division of Crey Enterprises. Basically, it seems that the Nemesis Army provided Crey with the technology to make untraceable portals, and in exchance they agreed to build and run portals for the Nemesis Army. <br><br>Buried within all the legalese are a few more choice pieces of information, including service and resupply contracts for several Nemesis bases already established in the Shadow Shard. With this information and the locations of the previous Crey bases you captured, you could probably track down the Nemesis bases mentioned in the contracts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CreyTransfer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2900039509" "Dimensional transit schedule"
// DetailString :
"P2047293796" "These papers contain a complete schedule for all of the upcoming interdimensional transits planned by Crey Industries and the Nemesis Army. With this information, you could find their transit points and shut them down. <br><br>In true Nemesis Army tradition, everything has been handwritten on triplicate forms."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Portalbuilder2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P747121435" "Another portal device?"
// DetailString :
"P4263330009" "Your team destroyed a second portal device that was nearly a twin to the one made by the Rularuu Crey had captured and brought to Paragon City. It's almost as if the Rularuu in the Shadow Shard had been in contact with their bretheren. Or that they always knew how to build a portal device but never had the parts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SecondGates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1700956220" "Back-up gate report"
// DetailString :
"P1759426112" "As the gate was being shut down, a piece of data on Crey's network leapt to your attention: It looks like a confirmation that a second set of back-up portals was recently completed and is ready to go online at any moment should their main portal link be destroyed! It looks like the battle isn't over yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P482854149" "Explorers and Exploiters"
// DetailString :
"P689692841" "Dr. Thomas Quaterfield asked for your help to save the lives of several researchers who were in danger. One of the scientists told you that they'd seen another group of unknown researchers in the area."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P22237887" "Dr. Thomas Quaterfield asked for your help to save the lives of several researchers who were in danger. One of the scientists told you that they'd seen another group of unknown researchers in the area. <br><br>You next fought some of the Rularuu, and found that some of them had scavenged pieces of Crey equipment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode3Clue 
