"P564280917" "Dr. Thomas Quaterfield asked for your help to save the lives of several researchers who were in danger. One of the scientists told you that they'd seen another group of unknown researchers in the area. <br><br>You next fought some of the Rularuu, and found that some of them had scavenged pieces of Crey equipment. <br><br>You rescued another group of explorers who told you that they'd been ambushed by unknown attackers even before the Rularuu attacked them. <br><br>You next fought the Rularuu as you searched for proof that Crey was in the Shadow Shard. <br><br>You next fought Crey themselves and resuced several missing scientists from them. <br><br>Following up, you fought Crey forces out in the Shadow Shard."

