// Objective - Crates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2861363860" "Scientific Samples"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2866489862" "You examine the crate"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3575658608" "You have examined the crate"
// InteractActionString :
"P1412195360" "Examining..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1538192395" "You have recovered a crate of valuable scientific samples"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2645143546" "You rescued the missing soldiers and scientists"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2540768371" "We were able to get almost everyone back alive thanks to your efforts. Good work, {TaskForceName}. <br><br>Dr. Fibes' comment about seeing another group of researchers is very troubling. There have been a few unconfirmed reports before, but all we've ever seen are the native people and the monsters who live here. And the natives know better than to disect a natterling. I may need to expand the role of your Task Force."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_KillTask2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P783152321" "There have been reports from patrols around Point Bravo that some of the local creatures have been seen with bits of new technology. They may have scavenged them from these mysterious research teams like the one Dr. Fibes and his people claimed to have seen. I need {TaskForceName} to examine the Shard Creatures around Point Bravo to see if they've encountered these unknown visitors."
// AcceptString :
"P1351219910" "Defeat Shard Creatures to see if they have any scavenged equipment"
// SendOffString :
"P2454017433" "The Shard creatures aren't going to let you get close to them without a fight. Good luck"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1016088262" "Examine creatures at Bravo"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P213152783" "We need to find out who else is out here and what they're up to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3269853613" "You found some items of Crey manufacture."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1765734321" "This is definitely Crey equipment. It doesn't prove anything, lots of people still use Crey tools and instruments. However, it does seem to point towards something. It may be unscientific, but I have a hunch we'll have the proof we need soon enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2606798251" "We may have to wait a while before continuing the Crey investigation. Another science team went missing, this time out at point X-Ray. They may be in worse trouble, though. The last transmission we got from them sounded like it was in the middle of a war zone."
// AcceptString :
"P1770580054" "Rescue field team at point X-Ray"
// SendOffString :
"P1721516860" "Okay, {TaskForceName}, this operation will follow the same plan as the last rescue. First, you'll need to engage the Rularuu around Point X-Ray to clear the area, then you'll go to the research team's last known location and extract them. I know you can handle it."

