// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3946883461" "When the soldiers were killed, I thought that was it for us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3734178117" "Body"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3578326698" "You begin to examine the body"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4051634710" "You have finished examining the body"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1799003930" "This soldier was killed by a high-tech weapon. You take the body back for proper burial."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4016539313" "You found the explorers, and got the survivors to safety."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P372779355" "Thank you again, {TaskForceName}. If it weren't for you, we'd only have bodies to send back to Paragon, not living people. The stories we're getting now are starting to come together. Once the autopsies on those soldiers are done, we may have a better idea of what's going on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_KillTask4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P534390291" "We got the autopsies back on the soldiers you found. They were killed by Crey weaponry. Now, I'm sure you've had run-ins with Crey in the past, but this time it may not actually be their fault. <br><br>First of all, Crey has no way to access the Shadow Shard without going through the portal at Firebase Zulu. Secondly, there are some creatures out there who can mimic all kinds of things, and we know that the Rularuu are intelligent. They might have learned to use or mimic Crey technology, which could be an even greater threat. So, the next step is trying to prove if this was actually Crey."
// AcceptString :
"P3508473764" "Gather evidence of Crey presence in the Shadow Shard."
// SendOffString :
"P634284167" "Your goal is to look for any signs of Crey activity in the area around Fire Base Zulu. Scour the area, look everywhere in this zone. If you can find proof positive that Crey is here, then we can start to figure out how they got here. You'll also need to tangle with the Rularuu to either prove or disprove that they might have acquired or learned to mimic Crey technology themselves."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2870056163" "Defeat Rularuu, Crey"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4114447514" "You need to find and defeat both Rularuu creatures and Crey troops."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1068112366" "You've found enough Crey to prove their presence."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1163570787" "From what you tell me things are getting really weird out there. I'll take the evidence you gathered and present it to Hammond. I'm sure he'll listen to this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4191835483" "General Hammond is talking to the UN about the evidence you gathered about Crey's illegal presence here. In the meantime, we've had a lucky break. You remember those explorers who were still missing, the ones who may have been kidnapped? Well, one of the locals just came and told us that she'd seen people meeting thier description being taken to a location on Point Tango. According to the witness, those scientists were under guard by what sounds like Crey troops. This could be a chance to get the rest of my people back safely, and prove that Crey's up to no good out here."
// AcceptString :
"P2858467996" "Rescue scientists and prove Crey presence"
// SendOffString :
"P4227988024" "I had a team of Hammond's scouts confirm the location, but it looks like it's going to be dangerous in there. You'll need to rescue all of the explorers and take out the enemy leader to prove it was Crey."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3486015724" "Defeat Crey Leader & guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P900641324" "You'll need to rescue all of the explorers and take out the enemy leader to prove it was Crey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3927151171" "You enter the cave pin-pointed on your map by the information from the natives and General Hammond's scouts."

