// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1291313238" "You succesfully defeated the Crey forces and rescued the scientists they'd kidnapped"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1523416860" "Well, that tears it. There's no doubt any more that Crey have found their way to the Shadow Shard illegally, and are presenting a clear threat. With all of their legal troubles right now, you'd think they'd try to lie low. <br><br>I'll present this new evidence to General Hammond. We'll need to figure out how to handle this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_KillTask6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1080702879" "Crey Enterprises is denying all knowledge of any illegal presence in the Shadow Shard, but everyone knew that was coming. In the meantime, we need to know what they're doing here and what their objectives are. To that end, I want you to go looking for them out in the Shard."
// AcceptString :
"P3273234847" "Battle Crey in the Shadow Shard"
// SendOffString :
"P4207195181" "Take on any Crey forces you find around the Fire Base Zulu area. You might want to concetrate your search around Point Echo, there have been a lot of reports that there might be Crey troops up there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4268842207" "Fight Crey around Zulu"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4103353395" "One of the defeated Crey soldiers had some orders from higher-ups."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P591758037" "Well, this answers some of our questions. There are a lot of big discoveries being made out here, and Crey might be looking for new patents to keep themselves afloat. It still seems like a huge risk. <br><br>More importantly, we may be able to work out where Crey's operating from with this. That could let us get the jump on them. I'll see what I can find. I think {TaskForceName} is about to have a change in priorities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1277704985" "General Hammond has seen fit to put further investigation into Crey's presence under my command, since it's a science-based threat. That's a vote of confidence not just in me, but in your work and skill. Now we have to show him that trust is well placed. <br><br>Okay, {TaskForceName}, all of your hard work is starting to pay off. With the information you've captured from Crey patrols and our own sources among the locals, we've been able to locate a series of caverns where Crey have been organizing some of their patrols around Point Echo. They don't know we know this, so a well-timed strike there could get a lot of information."
// AcceptString :
"P1124043906" "Strike Crey forward explorers"
// SendOffString :
"P231871012" "Your main objective in this one will be to take out the base's leadership. Those are the ones who'll have the information we're looking for. <br><br>There may also be other information and samples that Crey has gathered, capturing those will be highly advantageous, but not neccessary for victory."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2541112508" "Defeat Crey base leaders"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
