// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3230716599" "If it had been a snake, it would have bit me. The Nemesis Army. Of course! With them mixed up in this, it changes everything. I've already asked a lot out of you, {TaskForceName}, but there's going to be a lot still to do. This is probalby the halfway point, but now that the Nemesis Army is involved, we're going to need your help more than ever."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_Mission14 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2348502282" "Your hard work has won us a lot of battles, {TaskForceName}, but we're only just starting to see what the real threat looks like. Somehow, Crey's gotten hold of Nemesis Army plans for an untraceable portal device. We don't know if they stole that technology, bought it, or traded it for something, and it's vital that we find out the truth. <br><br>Information found in one of the bases you captured has let us locate where a meeting is going to take place between Crey representatives and negotiators from the Nemesis Army. It's a front company in Paragon city, and it's sure to be well defended."
// AcceptString :
"P3403713449" "Stop meeting between Crey and Nemesis Army"
// SendOffString :
"P4088013433" "The meeting will be taking place under the cover of a normal-looking business, but don't let that fool you. There will probably be some of Nemesis' automatons out in front to make it look normal, but your goal is to capture the negotiators and their documents."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P411714630" "Defeat negotiators"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2448717342" "Your goal is to capture the negotiators and their documents. That should provide us with the information we need."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P967812109" "The offices of this supposed law firm have a distinctly unused feel to them."

