// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2925282657" "Crey Industries and the Nemesis Army working together to exploit the Shadow Shard. It's fiendish. They have to be stopped, and thanks to your hard work, it just might be possible to put an end to their illegal collusion."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_Mission15 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P783853400" "General Hammond ran the information you recovered through several Nemesis experts, and they think it's legitimate. I borrowed some of the mainframes we have running simulations and had them figure out the most likely positions of the Nemesis Army's bases around Fire Base Zulu. General Hammond has given me the okay to send a team against one of them, as long as that team is {TaskForceName}. I couldn't agree more."
// AcceptString :
"P3520578561" "Strike a Nemesis base in the Shadow Shard"
// SendOffString :
"P982186437" "This is a probing strike, an experimental attack to see if our calculations are right and that this isn't a Nemesis Army trap. Your goal is to take out all the personnel in a small observatory base out at Point Sierra. This one shouldn't be that complex, just shut the base down and you're done."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P843649631" "Defeat all Nemesis Army in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2552198173" "This is a probing strike, an experimental attack to see if our calculations are right and that this isn't a Nemesis Army trap. Your goal is to take out all the personel in a small observatory base out at point Sierra. This one shouldn't be that complex, just shut the base down and you're done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2495422726" "The moment you step inside you know that your intelligence was correct. This is definitely a Nemesis base."

