"P2488773622" "We've got coordinates for another Nemesis Army base in the Shadow Shard. This one is on Point Alpha, within fast striking range of Fire Base Zulu. That alone makes taking this base out imperative."
// AcceptString :
"P759138418" "Take out Nemesis Army base at Point Alpha"
// SendOffString :
"P2920941777" "Your objective will be to defeat and capture the base's leadership. In addition, Hammond's scouts think this place might have valuable information, so see what you can find. There's also a possible complication: The Rularuu have been seen massing around this Nemesis Army base. They may be getting ready to make an attack of their own, so be careful."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2519642204" "Defeat Nemesis base leaders"

