"P2499233626" "Here's the situation, {TaskForceName}: <br><br>After you shut down the Shadow Shard end Crey's portal, Crey struck back in retaliation. They're trying to override one of our portals here in Fire Base Zulu! You'll need to go in and shut down one of our own portals before Crey overrides it completely and swamps us with troops."
// AcceptString :
"P1686717507" "Shut down portal in Firebase Zulu before Crey takes it over."
// SendOffString :
"P3789742007" "Things will be pretty dangerous in there. You'll need to simultaneously override two computers to prevent Crey from overriding the portal, and you'll need to defeat every Crey soldier in there to keep them from attempting a second portal override. I have every confidence in you, {TaskForceName}, and I know General Hammond does as well. Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1360428587" "Defeat all Crey"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3497240561" "You'll need to simultaneously override two computers to prevent Crey from overriding the portal, and you'll need to defeat every Crey soldier in there to keep them from attempting a second portal override. "

