// Dialog :
"P180512378" "You have shut down Crey's portal, but discovered that several Rularuu had gotten through"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P608562641" "With Crey's main portal shut down, that should lower their threat to our people in the Shadow Shard. It's more than likely that they'll soon build a new portal somewhere in the world, but for now their plans have been set back a long way. What's more, with all the samples you've recovered, I'm sure Portal Corp will find a way to detect and jam that new Portal technology in time. All of you in {TaskForceName} should take a moment and give yourselves a pat on the back for all of your hard work. <br><br>However, there's one more thing left to do. A few of the Rularuu got through into Paragon City. They need to be found and contained. I'll have some people look over news reports, and see if they can find anything that might match."
// RandomFameString :
"P1215885904" "I think I saw some strange creatures flying around. Stranger than usual, I mean."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFQ_Mission22 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1033323706" "It didn't take long for reports about the escaped Rularuu to come in. We've tracked them down, they're in a section of caverns deep below the city. You'll need to defeat or capture all of them and make sure that they can't complete any of those cobbled-together portal devices."
// AcceptString :
"P2580385038" "Hunt down the escaped Rularuu"
// SendOffString :
"P4275784128" "You'll need to hunt down and defeat every last one of the Rularuu to put an end to this. I should also warn you, the section of caves they're in are part of what some people call 'Oranbega', the supposed lost city of the Circle of Thorns. I suppose if you encounter any of them, they'll no doubt be hostile as well."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1366099114" "Defeat all Escaped Rularuu"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
